# HELIX Benchmark Reports Directory
#
# This directory contains generated benchmark reports:
# - overhead_report.json    - Full overhead analysis
# - overhead_report.md      - Markdown overhead report
# - scaling_report.md       - Scaling analysis report
# - prover_comparison.md    - GKR vs Halo2 comparison
# - regression_report.md    - Regression detection results
# - baseline.json           - Performance baseline for CI
#
# These files are generated by running:
# cargo bench --package helix-integration-tests
#
# Or for CI mode:
# cargo run --package helix-integration-tests --bin ci_benchmarks
